{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And one ewe lamb.</b> For a sin-offering." "<b>And three-tenths.</b> For the libations of these three lambs — for the sin-offering and the guilt-offering of the metsora require libations (Menachot 91a)." "<b>And one log of oil.</b> To sprinkle upon it seven times, and to put from it on the lobe of the ear and on the thumbs."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:06:22.802691772Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}